---
kind: lore
id: barks.stair
title: What the Stair says
---

<entry id="gatekeeperAgain" on="bossDefeated" target="boss.gatekeeper" category="bark">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The Gatekeeper falls again. The door remembers the shape of her fist.
</entry>

<entry id="wardenAgain" on="bossDefeated" target="boss.warden" category="bark">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The Warden folds onto the top step, as it always will, and the light under the door waits.
</entry>

<entry id="fallAgain" on="runEnd" category="bark" when="@fellThisClimb">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Floor {{run.floor}}. The steps rush upward. Warm stone.
</entry>
